{"slug":"norman-f-lent","qid":"Q328646","name":"Norman F. Lent","desc":"American lawyer and politician (1931–2012)","article":"Norman F. Lent","born":"1931-03-23","died":"2012-06-11","birthplace":"Oceanside","parties":["Republican Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"NY-04","f":1973,"u":1993},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"NY-05","f":1971,"u":1973},{"t":"State Senate of New York","w":"","f":1963,"u":1970}],"summary":"Norman Frederick Lent (March 23, 1931 – June 11, 2012) was an American lawyer and politician from New York. Under both the Republican and Conservative Party banners, he served in the New York State Senate from 1963 to 1970 and in the United States House of Representatives for 11 terms from 1971 to 1993. He is the last man to represent the district for more than one term.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":1990,"o":"H","k":"NY-04","p":"R","v":79304,"s":56.52,"w":true,"n":"Norman F Lent"},{"y":1988,"o":"H","k":"NY-04","p":"R","v":151038,"s":70.12,"w":true,"n":"Norman F Lent"},{"y":1986,"o":"H","k":"NY-04","p":"R","v":92214,"s":64.81,"w":true,"n":"Norman F Lent"},{"y":1984,"o":"H","k":"NY-04","p":"R","v":154875,"s":68.93,"w":true,"n":"Norman F Lent"},{"y":1982,"o":"H","k":"NY-04","p":"R","v":105241,"s":60.36,"w":true,"n":"Norman F Lent"},{"y":1980,"o":"H","k":"NY-04","p":"R","v":117455,"s":66.84,"w":true,"n":"Norman F Lent"},{"y":1978,"o":"H","k":"NY-04","p":"R","v":94711,"s":66.09,"w":true,"n":"Norman F Lent"},{"y":1976,"o":"H","k":"NY-04","p":"R","v":106058,"s":55.81,"w":true,"n":"Norman F Lent"}]}